ll-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2023 Q3","e":"shc","d":"2023-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Petras","x":"So if a condition comes through -- goes through phase 1, it has to pass through -- if it's leukemia or it's breast cancer, lymphoma, it has to go through phase 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/01/sotera-health-shc-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2024 Q1","e":"shc","d":"2024-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Petras","x":"This morning, we are reaffirming the outlook that we communicated in our last earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/02/sotera-health-shc-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2024 Q1","e":"shc","d":"2024-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jon Lyons","x":"As Michael mentioned, based on the first quarter and what we see for the remainder of this year, we are reaffirming the outlook we provided in February 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/02/sotera-health-shc-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2024 Q2","e":"shc","d":"2024-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Lyons","x":"As Michael mentioned, we are reaffirming our 2024 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/05/sotera-health-shc-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2024 Q2","e":"shc","d":"2024-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Lyons","x":"Brett, I would just say, the second quarter was in line with our expectations, and we're still hopeful that we'll see the gradual improvements in volumes in the back half of the year, which is reaffirming our guidance as well of that 4% to 6% top-line growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/05/sotera-health-shc-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SHC 2024 Q3","e":"shc","d":"2024-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Bednar","x":"Why is that pricing power lessening even w